1
00:00:00,380 --> 00:00:04,200
sparks of light / across my heart

2
00:00:04,610 --> 00:00:08,320
my quiet breath / shatters

3
00:00:08,320 --> 00:00:12,600
in an instant / consumed by you

4
00:00:13,090 --> 00:00:16,880
(whispered) wake up… wake up…

5
00:00:17,330 --> 00:00:19,330
over lights bleeding deep

6
00:00:19,330 --> 00:00:21,570
my feet move before I think

7
00:00:21,570 --> 00:00:23,550
broken rhythm, fractured air

8
00:00:23,550 --> 00:00:25,690
amid it all, only you are clear

9
00:00:25,690 --> 00:00:27,760
fading as they overlap

10
00:00:27,760 --> 00:00:30,070
neon shards cutting through me

11
00:00:30,070 --> 00:00:32,070
it hurts a little, but that's okay

12
00:00:32,070 --> 00:00:34,780
right now I'm on my way to you

13
00:00:34,930 --> 00:00:39,740
you're the signal / I'm the crash

14
00:00:39,740 --> 00:00:43,630
a glow spreading inside me now

15
00:00:43,630 --> 00:00:47,100
if this is all, just this once

16
00:00:47,340 --> 00:00:51,660
I won't hesitate

17
00:00:54,680 --> 00:00:56,410
I'm on my way to you

18
00:00:56,410 --> 00:00:58,450
after cutting through the light

19
00:00:58,450 --> 00:01:00,080
beyond every memory

20
00:01:00,080 --> 00:01:03,200
one name I ran toward

21
00:01:03,200 --> 00:01:04,800
I'm on my way to you

22
00:01:04,800 --> 00:01:06,960
following your fleeting breath

23
00:01:06,960 --> 00:01:10,050
a night that never stops

24
00:01:10,050 --> 00:01:16,310
a dream that ends with you

25
00:01:16,600 --> 00:01:18,480
through the gaps in broken lights

26
00:01:18,480 --> 00:01:20,200
you keep on shining

27
00:01:20,200 --> 00:01:21,120
if I reach out

28
00:01:21,120 --> 00:01:24,260
a glitchy love almost within reach

29
00:01:24,260 --> 00:01:26,660
unfamiliar, yet vividly you

30
00:01:26,660 --> 00:01:28,810
familiar, yet strangely me

31
00:01:28,810 --> 00:01:31,040
what opened up between us

32
00:01:31,060 --> 00:01:33,260
wasn't light — it was distance

33
00:01:33,980 --> 00:01:38,570
you're the pattern / I'm the error

34
00:01:38,570 --> 00:01:42,700
collapsed beat, bleeding color

35
00:01:42,700 --> 00:01:46,080
it's okay to break apart now

36
00:01:46,320 --> 00:01:49,580
because this is real

37
00:01:49,580 --> 00:01:51,170
I'm on my way to you

38
00:01:51,170 --> 00:01:53,270
a night spreading like an error

39
00:01:53,270 --> 00:01:54,860
even if I replay it all

40
00:01:54,860 --> 00:01:58,090
the ending is always you

41
00:01:58,090 --> 00:01:59,590
I'm on my way to you

42
00:01:59,590 --> 00:02:01,680
a heart like a vector, pointing toward you

43
00:02:01,680 --> 00:02:04,910
speaking without words

44
00:02:04,910 --> 00:02:10,750
"right now, I'm headed for you"

45
00:02:29,030 --> 00:02:30,830
as if my breath would stop

46
00:02:31,200 --> 00:02:33,060
light wraps around me

47
00:02:34,630 --> 00:02:37,160
my memories reboot

48
00:02:37,440 --> 00:02:39,270
a single pulse

49
00:02:39,670 --> 00:02:41,390
is this a dream

50
00:02:41,990 --> 00:02:44,430
still, I keep going—

51
00:02:44,430 --> 00:02:46,000
I'm on my way to you

52
00:02:46,000 --> 00:02:48,040
this is my last...

53
00:02:48,040 --> 00:02:49,630
even if I'm broken

54
00:02:49,630 --> 00:02:52,900
I want to reach you

55
00:02:52,900 --> 00:02:54,360
I'm on my way to you

56
00:02:54,360 --> 00:02:56,510
a heart burning hotter than speed

57
00:02:56,510 --> 00:02:59,330
that was everything

58
00:02:59,540 --> 00:03:03,650
it was you all along

